# A Luxel library scene — Apache-2.0. Grammar: library/README.md.
# The time drawn IN fire, with a clip layer (`X clip`, docs/spec/scenes.md §2
# "Clip layers"): an ember-coloured clock is the base, and the fire pattern
# above it is clipped to the clock's glyphs and LIGHTENS them, so the digits
# always glow and the flames run through them. Everything outside the digits
# stays black — without the X line the fire would cover the whole panel.
S - Fire Clock
U 32 32
L text 0 16 0 0 normal 100 none fill 1
N Embers
T clock HH:MM
F large 5a1404 c none 0
L pat 0 0 0 0 lighten 100 none fill 1
N Fire
I @pat/perlin-fire
C sliderFlameHeightPct 6553600
X clip
